ass=\"font-medium\">Stayed Dry & Fresh</p>\n            <span>No sudden sweats in the middle of the night, just all-night comfort and dryness.</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"s__product-page__why-breescape__item text-md flex flex-row gap-4 items-center\">\n        <div class=\"s__product-page__why-breescape__item-title title-md leading-none\">91%</div>\n        <div class=\"s__product-page__why-breescape__item-text text-sm text-left\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium\">Felt Cooler</p>\n            <span>Instantly cool and stays comfortable through the night, no more waking up hot.</span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
